│  **README**                                                                                                                       │
│                                                                                                                                   │
│  Welcome to the Greeting and Farewell System!                                                                                     │
│                                                                                                                                   │
│  This system provides a simple way to generate greetings and farewells for users. It consists of two main components:             │
│  `greeting.py` and `farewell.py`. The `greeting.py` component contains a function `greet(name)` that returns a greeting message,  │
│  while the `farewell.py` component contains a function `farewell(name)` that returns a farewell message.                          │
│                                                                                                                                   │
│  **Installation**                                                                                                                 │
│                                                                                                                                   │
│  To install the system, simply clone the repository and run the following commands:                                               │
│                                                                                                                                   │
│  ```bash                                                                                                                          │
│  git clone https://github.com/your-username/greeting-and-farewell-system.git                                                      │
│  cd greeting-and-farewell-system                                                                                                  │
│  pip install -r requirements.txt                                                                                                  │
│  ```                                                                                                                              │
│                                                                                                                                   │
│  **Configuration**                                                                                                                │
│                                                                                                                                   │
│  The system does not require any configuration. However, you can customize the greeting and farewell messages by modifying the    │
│  `greeting.py` and `farewell.py` files.                                                                                           │
│                                                                                                                                   │
│  **Environment Variables**                                                                                                        │
│                                                                                                                                   │
│  The system does not use any environment variables.                                                                               │
│                                                                                                                                   │
│  **API Usage**                                                                                                                    │
│                                                                                                                                   │
│  The system provides two APIs:                                                                                                    │
│                                                                                                                                   │
│  * `greet(name)`: Returns a greeting message for the given name.                                                                  │
│  * `farewell(name)`: Returns a farewell message for the given name.                                                               │
│                                                                                                                                   │
│  You can use these APIs by importing the `greeting.py` and `farewell.py` modules and calling the `greet()` and `farewell()`       │
│  functions.                                                                                                                       │
│                                                                                                                                   │
│  **Architecture**                                                                                                                 │
│                                                                                                                                   │
